  "details": "RESTEasy contains a JBoss project that provides frameworks to help build RESTful Web Services and RESTful Java applications. It is a fully certified and portable implementation of the JAX-RS specification.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * resteasy-core: RESTeasy SourceProvider remote unauthenticated file read (CVE-2026-17615)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
